# Bundle the wine CSVs (the default dataset) with the repo. Both lines are
# required: `datasets/*` above excludes the parent directory, and git cannot
# re-include a path under an excluded directory, so the directory has to be
# un-excluded first. The redundant .zip (same CSVs) stays ignored.
!datasets/wine_quality/
!datasets/wine_quality/**
datasets/wine_quality/wine+quality.zip
datasets/wine_quality/wine+quality/winequality.names
datasets/wine_quality/.DS_Store